  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Where you from",
   "texto": [
    "**Woher kommst du?** is «Where did you come from?» (with «Sie»: **Woher kommen Sie?**).",
    "**Ich komme aus Spanien** (I come from Spain). **Aus** is «of», for origin.",
    "Nationality is a **nombre**, with capital and no article. It has the form masculine and feminine, which usually adds **-in**: **Ich bin Spanier** (I am Spanish), **Ich bin Spanierin** (I am Spanish)."
   ]
  },
